WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.500
A multi-camera live show.

2
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:03.000
Just phones.

3
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Phones join by QR code.

4
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:10.000
The phone knows when it is live.

5
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Preview. Take. On air.

6
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Layouts in one click.

7
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:20.500
The program is a web page.

8
00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:23.000
OBS picks it up.

9
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Self-hosted. One docker compose. On your network. Open source, MIT.

10
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:28.000
StudioFlow. Go live from any phone. opten.github.io/StudioFlow. Sponsored by OPTEN.
